xlink:href=\"#Cmsy10-2f\" transform=\"translate(269.11 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-29\" transform=\"translate(323.05 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-28\" transform=\"translate(420.74 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmmi10-33\" transform=\"translate(470.74 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-28\" transform=\"translate(498.42 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-31\" transform=\"translate(548.42 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-78\" transform=\"translate(598.42 0.24)\"/><path d=\"M 6.25 22.11 L 6.25 28.36 L 296.8 28.36 L 296.8 22.11 L 6.25 22.11 z \"/></g></g><g id=\"text_16\"><!-- $\\dfrac{\\epsilon}{|\\mathcal{A}(s_t)|} = 0.025$ --><g style=\"fill: #0095db\" transform=\"translate(448.24 208.75) scale(0.15 -0.15)\"><use xlink:href=\"#Cmmi10-36\" transform=\"translate(131.25 67.89)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmsy10-2f\" transform=\"translate(6.25 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmsy10-5a\" transform=\"translate(33.94 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-77\" transform=\"translate(113.72 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmmi10-58\" transform=\"translate(152.54 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmmi10-30\" transform=\"translate(199.32 -86.64) scale(0.7)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-44\" transform=\"translate(230.3 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmsy10-2f\" transform=\"translate(269.11 -71.64)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-29\" transform=\"translate(323.05 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-28\" transform=\"translate(420.74 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmmi10-33\" transform=\"translate(470.74 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-28\" transform=\"translate(498.42 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-31\" transform=\"translate(548.42 0.24)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#Cmr10-78\" transform=\"translate(598.42 0.24)\"/><path d=\"M 6.25 22.11 L 6.25 28.36 L 296.8 28.36 L 296.8 22.11 L 6.25 22.11 z \"/></g></g><g id=\"text_17\"><!-- Política $\\epsilon$-gulosa, com $\\epsilon = 0.1$ e $|\\mathcal{A}(s_t)| = 4$ --><g style=\"fill: #222222\" transform=\"translate(167.38 23.7) scale(0.16 -0.16)\"><defs><path id=\"LMSans10-Regular-53\" d=\"M 3725 3149 C 3725 3834 3091 4442 2208 4442 L 614 4442 L 614 0 L 1184 0 L 1184 1850 L 2253 1850 C 3046 1850 3725 2432 3725 3149 z M 3206 3149 C 3206 2643 2803 2221 2067 2221 L 1165 2221 L 1165 4083 L 2067 4083 C 2771 4083 3206 3693 3206 3149 z \" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LMSans10-Regular-48\" d=\"M 998 0 L 998 4442 L 518 4442 L 518 0 L 998 0 z \" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LMSans10-Regular-151\" d=\"M 998 0 L 998 2842 L 518 2842 L 518 0 L 998 0 z M 1869 4442 L 1370 4442 L 518 3373 L 909 3373 L 1869 4442 z \" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LMSans10-Regular-40\" d=\"M 1766 1235 L 1766 1606 L 70 1606 L 70 1235 L 1766 1235 z \" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LMSans10-Regular-3b\" d=\"M 3104 2509 L 3034 2912 C 2586 2912 2214 2790 2022 2707 C 1888 2816 1670 2912 1414 2912 C 864 2912 397 2451 397 1869 C 397 1632 480 1402 608 1235 C 422 973 422 723 422 691 C 422 525 480 339 589 205 C 256 6 179 -288 179 -454 C 179 -934 813 -1318 1594 -1318 C 2381 -1318 3014 -941 3014 -448 C 3014 442 1946 442 1696 442 L 1133 442 C 1050 442 762 442 762 781 C 762 851 787 954 832 1011 C 966 915 1178 826 1414 826 C 1990 826 2438 1299 2438 1869 C 2438 2176 2298 2413 2227 2509 L 2253 2502 C 2394 2502 2573 2528 2726 2528 C 2842 2528 3104 2509 3104 2509 z M 1990 1869 C 1990 1370 1690 1190 1414 1190 C 1178 1190 845 1338 845 1869 C 845 2400 1178 2547 1414 2547 C 1690 2547 1990 2368 1990 1869 z M 2566 -461 C 2566 -742 2125 -954 1600 -954 C 1082 -954 627 -755 627 -454 C 627 -435 627 -19 1126 -19 L 1702 -19 C 1843 -19 2566 -19 2566 -461 z \" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LMSans10-Regular-2d\" d=\"M 1152 6 L 1152 531 L 621 531 L 621 0 L 781 0 L 621 -800 L 883 -800 L 1152 6 z \" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"Cmr10-3b\" d=\"M 178 1056 L 178 1281 L 2156 4231 Q 2178 4263 2222 4263 L 2316 4263 Q 2388 4263 2388 4191 L 2388 1281 L 3016 1281 L 3016 1056 L 2388 1056 L 2388 428 Q 2388 297 2575 261 Q 2763 225 300